THIRD-PARTY LICENSES — GeoLibre dynamical-grib wasm

Inventory from cargo metadata --locked --filter-platform wasm32-unknown-unknown,
using Cargo.lock and the pinned gribberish commit. Runtime means crates reachable
from the wrapper through normal dependencies, stopping at proc-macro crates;
build-dependency-only and proc-macro-only crates are excluded. This lists the
Cargo dependency closure, conservatively including crates whose unused code may
be eliminated by release LTO. Rust's standard library is outside Cargo metadata.

License texts were copied from the downloaded sources in Cargo's registry/git
cache. Identical texts are included once and referenced by L identifiers. Only
trailing whitespace was normalised. Both MIT and Apache alternatives are kept
where supplied, along with Zlib, Unicode, Unlicense and other supplied notices.
No separate NOTICE files were present in the runtime crate source trees.
The two gribberish crates share their repository-root MIT license.
The wrapper is GeoLibre's MIT code and uses GeoLibre's root LICENSE.
Keep this file with redistributions of gribwasm_bg.wasm.

